SELECT ten FROM onek WHERE unique1 IN (VALUES (1), (2) OFFSET 1);
                     QUERY PLAN                     
----------------------------------------------------
 Nested Loop
   ->  HashAggregate
         Group Key: "*VALUES*".column1
         ->  Limit
               ->  Values Scan on "*VALUES*"
   ->  Index Scan using onek_unique1 on onek
         Index Cond: (unique1 = "*VALUES*".column1)
(7 rows)

